Significance: minor
Type: fix

Include selected Any variation attribute values in classic cart and checkout-created order item names. Adds WC_Cart::get_item_product_name() and an optional third parameter to wc_get_formatted_cart_item_data(); overridden cart templates keep their previous display until updated. Also stops order item metadata from repeating variation attribute values that contain special characters (such as &) already shown in the item name, including on existing orders.
